---
// Telegram chat list: the fleet of named specialists.
---

<div
  class="tg-card tg"
  role="img"
  aria-label="Telegram chat list showing a fleet of named Switchroom assistants: clerk the chief of staff, marko the marketer, coach the health coach, quill the writing partner, and klanker the fleet admin, each with a recent message preview. Clerk has one unread message."
>
  <div class="tg-head list-head" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="edit">Edit</span>
    <span class="who"><b>Chats</b></span>
    <span class="compose">✎</span>
  </div>
  <div class="tg-list" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="chat">
      <span class="tg-ava a1">c</span>
      <div class="cbody">
        <div class="l1"><b>clerk</b><time>9:42</time></div>
        <div class="l2"><span>Booked. Thu 2:30 with Dr Chen — invite sent.</span><span class="badge">1</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chat">
      <span class="tg-ava a2">m</span>
      <div class="cbody">
        <div class="l1"><b>marko</b><time>9:15</time></div>
        <div class="l2"><span>Three hooks drafted — the second one's the keeper</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chat">
      <span class="tg-ava a3">co</span>
      <div class="cbody">
        <div class="l1"><b>coach</b><time>7:02</time></div>
        <div class="l2"><span>Morning. Sleep score 84 — good night for intervals</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chat">
      <span class="tg-ava a5">q</span>
      <div class="cbody">
        <div class="l1"><b>quill</b><time>Yesterday</time></div>
        <div class="l2"><span class="muted-check">✓✓</span><span>Second draft attached — tightened the opening</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="chat">
      <span class="tg-ava a4">k</span>
      <div class="cbody">
        <div class="l1"><b>klanker</b><time>Yesterday</time></div>
        <div class="l2"><span>Fleet healthy. All 5 agents up, backups clean.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
